WEBVTT

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.480
<i>I don't regret</i>

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.780
<i>what I did for him that day.</i>

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:17.400
<i>As for what I said to him that day...</i>

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.000
<i>I have nothing but regrets.</i>

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.120
So...

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:46.380
What was her name again?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.590
Ah, Kenny. I know you're both experts,

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:07.230
but please make sure you not only find out,

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:12.060
but also record as much as possible 
about these potential customers' needs.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:14.890
Right. Let's get to it. 
Looking forward to seeing you.

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:21.760
Hey, wait.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:22.900
What about breakfast?

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.610
Forward World Gaiden

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.610
A new adventure

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:52.350
Damn that woman, 
making me stay up all night...

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.160
I'm definitely not seeing her again.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.430
I'm pretty dizzy...

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.690
<i>Oh, shit.</i>

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.650
<i>I'm falling.</i>

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:20.780
I-I'm so sorry!

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.730
Ow...

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.370
Are you okay?

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:29.750
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.620
I-I'm sorry! I panicked 
and ended up hooking you.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:33.970
Are you hurt at all?

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:35.970
Nah, I'm fine.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:38.780
Thanks. I could've been a goner.

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:41.720
I'm sorry I ended up strangling you.

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:44.560
Um, you look a bit pale.

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.320
Yeah, I haven't been feeling well.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:50.150
Huh? Did you have any breakfast?

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:51.940
What? No, I didn't.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.610
That might be why.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.360
Do I have anything to eat... Wait.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.360
Oh, no! I'm going to be late!

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:02.130
Um, uh... Here! You can have this!

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:02.620
Huh?

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.130
Well, take care!

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.460
I'm going to be late!

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:13.250
What should we do for lunch?

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.170
Want to eat out?

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:16.080
Why don't we try that new pasta place?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.570
Think we'll be able to leave on time today?

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:22.840
Gonna have to rush after lunch.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:24.970
Are you okay?

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.480
<i>She had the same uniform as Rio...</i>

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.400
<i>So much ham...</i>

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.740
Welcome back, Onii-chan.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.670
I've got a friend over right now.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:47.990
A friend?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.250
Hey, I saw you this morning.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:59.090
Wait, you two know each other?

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.440
I wouldn't go that far.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:04.030
She saved my life.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:04.700
Huh?

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:10.520
It's Mom. I'll be right back, Ichika.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.590
Sure...

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.640
I'll ask for the deets after this call.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.260
Mom? What's up?

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:27.580
I never thought you'd be 
one of my sister's friends.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.380
Uh...

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:30.660
Oh, I'm Arima Ichika.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.440
Ichika-chan. I'm Ryo.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:36.530
Now that I know you're my sister's 
friend, I should thank you properly.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:39.580
Huh? No, you don't need to do anything.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:40.670
Maybe clothes or shoes?

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.970
No, really...

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:45.240
Yeah, that does seem kinda cheap.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:48.430
Then how about...

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.440
a kiss?

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:55.300
Sorry, what?

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:59.570
Yeah, a kiss might be a bit 
much for a high school girl.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:03.690
You saved my life, so I'll 
do pretty much anything.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.420
Of course, if you want, I could 
go even further than that.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.540
It'd be a nice memory, wouldn't it?

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:10.450
What do you think?

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:17.580
You're creepy.

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:19.170
Huh?

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:23.480
<b>Creepy</b>

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:29.820
<b>Creepy</b>

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:29.820
Creepy... Creepy... Creepy...

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:29.820
Creepy? Creepy? C-Creepy?

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:33.560
You're offering up yourself as thanks 
for saving you? What are you thinking?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:37.370
That's not why I saved you.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:40.940
I'm sorry!

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:45.500
I just blurt out what I'm thinking... 
I mean... Really, I don't need anything!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.110
<i>Squee.</i>

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:46.110
<b>Squee</b>

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:46.280
<b>Squee</b>

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.320
Uh, what the heck was that sound?

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:54.090
Magnificent...

00:05:55.930 --> 00:06:00.350
Not only did you save me, but you had 
the benevolence to give me your lunch.

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:04.590
To top it off, your clear, 
cold response to my shallow idea...

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.140
I'm moved.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:10.850
I'm absolutely moved! 
I've never felt like this before!

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:14.310
Ichika-san! You're the girl 
I'm destined to be with!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.980
Sorry about that, Ichika. 
I'm done with my call now.

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:21.150
Huh? Where'd my brother go?

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.700
Uh, he's down here!

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.800
Help me! What's going on?!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:56.990
Koikimo

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:02.000
Episode 1

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:02.000
"He's Not Entirely Bad"

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:03.750
I'm home.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:07.990
Ichika! A package came for you.

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.260
Oh, did the manga I ordered get here?

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:15.510
You got a rose from someone 
named Amakusa Ryo-san.

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:20.140
My brother seriously sent you a rose?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.020
That's hilarious.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.980
It's not hilarious at all! 
Why did you give him my address, Rio?

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.750
Then my mom asked me about it... 
It was such a mess.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:32.370
Well, my brother seemed super serious 
about this, so it just happened.

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:33.950
"Just happened"? As if!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.600
Yesterday, he had you give 
me expensive chocolates.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:37.300
From
my brother

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.430
G-
Godi...

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.400
The day before that, it was a plushie.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:41.660
From my brother

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:41.980
He's been giving me insane presents 
every day this week since we met.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:41.660
A-
A teddy bear...

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:46.540
Is Ryo-san like this to everyone he asks out?

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.020
Not at all. He's pretty indifferent.

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:51.610
According to him, he's never 
even asked anyone out.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.820
Seriously?

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:53.420
Yup.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.630
Who cares? Why not go out with him?

00:08:55.630 --> 00:09:00.230
Yikes! You're okay with your friend 
going out with your brother?

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.570
If it's you, sure.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:02.270
Say what?!

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:06.730
My brother's hot, smart, 
and he's fairly loaded.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.750
Not bad, right? He's a scumball, though.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:11.610
I'm sorry, did you just say "scumball"?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.970
Besides, if you two went out, it'd be amus—

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.390
It'd make me happy.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.830
You were totally going to say "amusing."

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:24.330
By the way, did you call 
my brother to complain?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.130
What? No...

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:29.590
Well, if you don't, he'll probably 
keep sending you stuff.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.680
Huh?

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:33.550
Here you go.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.320
Onii-chan

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:35.010
My brother's number.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.800
Thanks.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:40.560
He's probably working right now, 
so try contacting him at night.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:41.570
Right...

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:43.560
<b>Uh...</b>

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.100
E-Excuse me, Acting Section Chief Amakusa.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:51.860
What is it, Suzuki-san?

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:56.860
Um... I just wanted to thank you 
for backing me up at the meeting.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:00.570
Ah... That was nothing. 
I just added on to what you said.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:03.250
Just make sure you adjust the cost.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:04.430
See you later.

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.590
He's so hot...

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:10.670
He really is.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.160
Look at that body.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.500
He's amazing.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.760
I don't know this number.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:23.010
Hello?

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:24.260
Um...

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.690
<i>Hello?</i>

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:29.130
<i>I-Is that you, Ichika-san?!</i>

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.900
How could you tell just from my voice?

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:37.130
I'm never going to forget 
your beautiful voice.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:39.020
It's ingrained into my brain.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:41.910
<i>Could you not say stuff like that?</i>

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:45.530
<i>Listen, about that flower you sent...</i>

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:47.040
Oh, did it get to you?

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.540
<i>Do you not like roses?</i>

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:53.500
Huh? No, I don't dislike them...

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.020
<i>Oh, thank goodness.</i>

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:59.010
<i>I sent you a rose first so it would 
convey my feelings clearly.</i>

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:03.640
Huh? Uh... Er, that's not what this is about.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:09.500
<i>I get it. You must not like red. 
I knew I should've gone with pink.</i>

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:13.190
Seriously, this isn't about 
roses or their color.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:16.110
Did you think it was from Tuxedo Mask?

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.530
<i>Of course not.</i>

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:18.440
I'm saying—

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.870
<i>Was it a bother?</i>

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:20.510
Huh?

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:23.900
Am I bothering you?

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:31.210
Um... I'm not sure how I'm supposed 
to respond to you giving me a flower.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:34.670
To be honest... i-it <i>is</i> a bother.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:36.910
<i>I see.</i>

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:38.170
I'm sorry.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.050
But I'm not going to stop.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.720
Wait, what?

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:47.680
<i>I just can't control my feelings for you.</i>

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:50.980
I'm hoping things will 
continue to take shape.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:51.910
<i>What?</i>

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:55.620
I'm planning to do things 
that will make you happy,

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:58.330
and even annoy you,
all to show you my love.

00:11:58.330 --> 00:11:59.770
<i>I hope you look forward to it.</i>

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:05.120
S-So you're saying that you don't 
care if it's bothering me or not.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.890
You're going to pursue me regardless?

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:08.970
<i>Correct.</i>

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:12.870
<i>So it's perfectly fine for you to get 
mad and curse at me all you'd like.</i>

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.080
<i>I won't find it unpleasant at all.</i>

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.970
Not bad, right? He's a scumball, though.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:21.260
<i>He really is a scumball!</i>

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.260
He
really
is
a
scum
ball

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.850
<i>Y-You're awful! How can you be so awful?!</i>

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:28.600
Oh, that's great! I can feel 
the icy needles in those words.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.860
Yell at me more.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:35.400
Never mind! Just don't send me 
any more flowers or anything else!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.650
<i>Goodnight!</i>

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.470
Contacts

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.470
Ichika-san

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.470
Mobile

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.470
Memo

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.910
And... saved.

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:49.580
Thanks for doing this.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.960
Sure. I'll be home later.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.710
<b>Today
only!</b>

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.710
<b>Mixed-sized eggs
10 eggs in a pack</b>

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.710
1 carton
per customer

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.710
<b>99 yen
with tax</b>

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.710
Quantities are limited.
Our stock may run out.
Please contact your
local store for availability. {fine print}

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.710
So I need milk, eggs...

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.340
What else was there?

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:00.960
Olive oil, and...

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.220
Oh, I'm sorr— Ugh.

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:12.100
Ichika-san! It must be destiny that 
we saw each other on our day off!

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:15.460
Where's the usual cursing and insults?

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.270
Why would you be waiting for that?

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.660
You're so creepy.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:23.090
<b>1 pack
per customer</b>

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.820
<i>I really don't want to ask him...</i>

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:29.530
Hey.

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:32.130
I have a favor to ask.

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:36.210
Of course! I'll do anything you'd like!

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:36.920
<b>Flavors
of the Fall</b>

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:40.540
<b>99 yen
Eggs</b>

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.540
Oh, you're a lifesaver!

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:44.160
I was sure I'd only be able to buy one.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:49.930
<b>Eggs</b>

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:49.000
Ryo-san? A-Are you mad?

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:49.930
No...

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:54.060
I'm just overcome with emotions.
We're shopping like a married couple.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:57.150
Bless you, one-pack-per-customer rule.

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:59.000
Go ahead and choke on those emotions.

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.710
Oh, a limited edition is out.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.070
Limited Edition

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.070
Rich
<b>Chestnut</b>

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.070
Chocolate Revolution

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:09.790
Hey, they have the chocolate 
you like. Would you like some?

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:12.580
How do you know I like this kind?

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:14.570
My sister told me.

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:16.200
That's definitely a lie.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:17.710
<b>Fresh
From
the
Farm</b>

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:17.710
<b>Contains
100%
Milk</b>

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:19.330
But it's not a lie.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.330
<b>Eggs</b>

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:22.460
What's my favorite animal?

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:23.240
Cats.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.460
What kind of shampoo do I use?

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:28.090
Max Damage Repair!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:30.430
Yes! You're disgusting! That's correct!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.430
<b>Mild</b>

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.430
<b>Authentically Fruity</b>

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:37.060
"Extra virgin oil" sounds stronger,
like a secret technique...

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.440
Secret technique?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.090
No, I, uh—

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:43.600
<i>Oh, God! He heard me say 
something nerdy! Ack!</i>

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:48.110
Yeah, it does sound like it has 
three times the attack power.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:52.270
I'll go for the three times, then.

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:56.120
<i>I didn't think he'd go along with that.</i>

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.460
Here you go. Have a sample.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.170
Oh, thank you.

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:02.710
My, what a handsome boyfriend you have.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:03.630
Here you go.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.770
Thank you.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:05.920
He's not my boyfriend.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:10.150
It's good. Could I get a bag?

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:13.040
Sure thing. You can throw 
away the garbage there.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:14.510
Thank you so much.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.180
<b>S
t
a
r
e</b>

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:22.300
Why are you trying to retrieve my toothpick?

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:23.710
Was I that obvious?

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:26.400
Maybe you should just get 
stabbed by a million of them!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.190
<b>Thank you for your patronage</b>

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.200
Ryo-san...

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:32.700
No.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.200
I will not let you carry your groceries.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:39.830
Ugh! I bought them, so I'll carry them!

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.710
Maybe if you let me kiss you.

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.330
How are you this awful?

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:48.340
Okay, fine. You can carry them.

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:52.590
You must have a lot of 
experience with women.

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:53.630
No.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:58.840
I just want to do this because I like you.

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:10.400
Ugh, come on, then.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.400
By the way,

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:14.740
people were commenting on 
us being a young couple.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.370
I'm pretty sure they said, 
"What a young pervert."

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:21.530
But it was plural, 
so I guess that would include you.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.370
Please don't compare me to you.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.580
Amakusa

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:26.580
I'm home.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.090
Welcome back.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.980
That was fast. Did you go to 
the bookstore by the station?

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:31.970
No.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:36.470
I did the perfect one-per-customer 
deal with Ichika-san.

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:41.980
Welcome home.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:43.430
Here you go.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:47.640
Thanks. Oh, you got two 
packs of eggs? Perfect.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.790
Yeah, stuff happened...

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:53.240
Oh, right. Today, you got a carnation.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:17:01.620
This Amakusa-san person is so poetic, 
sending you a single flower every day.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.010
Huh? Why do you say that?

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:05.370
What? You didn't realize it?

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:08.660
It's because your name means 
"one flower," obviously.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:13.320
Ugh... I didn't want to hear that. 
I didn't want to realize that...

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:20.010
Koikimo

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:25.020
Koikimo

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:25.020
Gorgonzola sounds powerful, too.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:25.020
Sounds like a midboss in an RPG.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.020
Right. Yes.

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:30.520
Understood.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.470
I'll see you in an hour, then.

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:36.760
I guess I'll kill some time.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:44.000
<i>What the heck is this y?</i>

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:44.840
<i>I know.</i>

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.620
<i>Maybe if I anthropomorphize it, 
I'll feel like doing this...</i>

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:55.660
You seriously just sat down 
like you were invited.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.340
Very admirable, Ichika-san.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.910
You're keeping the insults quiet 
since we're out in public.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.010
Maybe I'll just pour that coffee on you.

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.330
Are you by yourself, Ichika-san?

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:05.770
I'm waiting for Rio.

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:09.650
I'm going to switch seats, 
so enjoy your coffee.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:13.530
But my seat is always meant 
to be across from you.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:17.150
Why do you keep showing up? 
What are you, a stalker?

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.280
This is honestly a coincidence.

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.030
Rio

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.030
Rio

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.030
I'll give you 10 minutes

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:23.850
Onii-chan

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:23.850
I'll buy you ice cream later

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.710
Are you studying?

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.960
I have a test coming up.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:32.500
You need to substitute this.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:33.710
Substitute?

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:37.860
Yes. Then transpose this, and then add.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.260
Transpose this and then add...

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:42.260
Oh, it worked!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.410
I get it...

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:48.710
Rio did mention that you were smart.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.280
I guess it's true.

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:53.190
Do you like smart men?

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.820
Maybe you're not that bright after all.

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:58.550
Are you good at science and math?

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:01.610
I'm definitely not.

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:05.520
Let's see... I did well in all subjects.

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:06.500
I'm a great athlete, too.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.870
Yeah, I'm not interested.

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:13.450
Well, if I had to pick, 
I'd say I'm not so good at art.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:18.880
Though now that I know you like art, 
I've been doing my best to improve.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:21.260
No point in wasting time for both of us.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:25.390
If you're that bad, try drawing something.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.730
Like, a portrait of me.

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:33.950
I cannot draw something so sublime with 
my lack of technique and capacity!

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:35.080
I will surely be punished!

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.150
How impudent of me!

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.900
Am I suddenly a deity or something?

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:40.660
Well, Ichika-san, you're—

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:41.700
Is that you, Ryo?

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:42.410
Huh?

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:43.360
Uh...

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:45.220
Wow, it's been forever.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:46.700
<i>Who is she again?</i>

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:51.410
You hadn't contacted me in a while, 
so I was wondering what was going on.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:53.230
Oh, I see...

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:56.040
So bright...

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:55.350
<i>Michiko? Maybe Sachiko?</i>

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:57.590
Jeez, at least be a little excited.

00:19:58.660 --> 00:19:59.890
Whoa, Ryo!

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:03.270
Don't tell me you got your filthy mitts 
on bland little high school girl like her.

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:03.930
What?

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.000
No, I'm not...

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:10.080
Come on, you can't just go for 
<i>any</i> girl. This poor thing.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:10.730
Er, I...

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:14.510
You should stay away from Ryo. 
He's honestly the worst.

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:17.020
He's a total womanizer.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.470
Though that's what I like about him.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:21.650
Hey, no one asked you.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:25.250
Oh, please. I'm sure you pulled 
the nice-guy act on her.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:28.330
I'm saying this for her sake.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.550
That's en—

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:29.550
Excuse me!

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:35.350
I have no doubt that he's a womanizer...

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.660
<i>D'oh!</i>

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:40.300
But I don't think he's 
entirely bad toward me.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.480
Probably...

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.870
Also, I'm just friends 
with his little sister.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.760
So please excuse me.

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:59.020
Whoopsie. Maybe I teased her too much.

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.070
Hey.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.190
Yeah?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:05.950
<b>Scrub Scrub Scrub Scrub</b>

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:04.140
Wha—

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:10.080
No way! My makeup! My fake lashes!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:13.140
How dare you interrupt 
my time with Ichika-san?

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:17.000
Don't make me pluck out 
all of your real eyelashes.

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:23.330
I need to contact Rio.

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:24.840
Ichika-san!

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:31.020
Wh-What? Isn't she your 
girlfriend or something?

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.680
No! She's nothing like that!

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:38.680
I'm sorry. That must've made you 
feel awful, all because of me.

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:39.850
It's fine.

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:40.760
Ichika-san...

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:44.360
What you said earlier made me happy.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:51.730
I just said what was on my mind...

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:54.460
<i>Squee!</i>

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.730
Did you just internally squee because 
you thought I was suddenly being nice?!

00:21:57.730 --> 00:22:00.920
That's amazing. How did you know? 
You're so impressive, Ichika-san!

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.610
It's totally obvious!

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:05.050
What are
those two
doing...?

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:05.050
Never mind! Just go home 
already, you stupid mutt!

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.590
Thank you for the compliment!

00:22:07.810 --> 00:22:09.720
That wasn't a compliment! 
Get back in your cage!

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:13.440
I'm an expert at shaking paws. 
Why don't we give it a try?

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:16.590
You're just trying to 
hold my hand, aren't you?

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:18.240
Oh, was I that obvious?

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:19.730
You think?

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.250
Next Time

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.250
"The Smell of Cologne"

00:23:36.070 --> 00:23:38.490
Next time, "The Smell of Cologne."
